<title>UK: UK shares advance amid short-squeeze.</title>
<headline>UK shares advance amid short-squeeze.</headline>
<text>
<p>** UK shares advance amid short squeeze. Drug, oil</p>
<p>	 sectors lead rally. Gilts hold firm ahead of UK</p>
<p>	 data, due at 0830 GMT.</p>
<p>** BAA jumps 2.6 pct as results meet forecasts.</p>
<p>** BP leads sector higher on rising crude. H1 due later.</p>
</text>
